# Keep test files out of the serverless build.
#
# Vercel turns every .ts file under api/ into a function, compiling it with its
# own settings (moduleResolution node16) rather than tsconfig.api.json — which
# deliberately excludes tests, because they import src through the "@" alias that
# does not exist in the Node project. So the first test ever added under api/
# failed the production build on an import that type-checks fine locally:
#
#   api/share-email.test.ts(12,38): error TS2835: Relative import paths need
#   explicit file extensions ... Did you mean './share-email.js'?
#
# Ignoring them here is also the right outcome on its own terms: a test file in
# api/ would otherwise be deployed as a public endpoint at /api/<name>.test.
api/**/*.test.ts
api/**/*.spec.ts
